# Process Charter: Hardware Asset Management (HAM)

## 1. Process Objective
Manage the hardware asset lifecycle from procurement and tagging to maintenance and eco-friendly disposal (E-Waste).

## 2. Hardware Lifecycle Stages
```text
[ Procurement ] ──> [ Inventory Tagging / CMDB ] ──> [ Active Deployment ]
                                                           │
[ E-Waste / Disposal ] <── [ Decommissioning ] <───────────┘
